        "faq-1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "shipping-delivery-times",
            "question": "When will my order be shipped?",
            "answer": "<p>The products listed on our website are in stock, so we strive to process, pack, and ship orders as quickly as possible. Once the shipment is handed over to the carrier, the shipping company will contact you directly regarding delivery. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "shipping-delivery-times",
            "question": "When will the shipment be delivered?",
            "answer": "<p>The exact estimated delivery time is listed directly next to the specific product - above the “Add to Cart” button or in the “Important Information” section.</p><p>The delivery date may be affected by current warehouse workload, carrier capacity, or ongoing promotions and campaigns. In such cases, we provide up-to-date delivery information directly on our website <br/><br/><br/><br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "shipping-delivery-times",
            "question": "Can I choose an exact delivery date?",
            "answer": "<p>We strive to process every order as quickly as possible. If you’d like to delay processing, please contact us via email. However, the exact delivery date and time depend on the shipping carrier, over which we have no direct control. If you need delivery on a specific day or time, we recommend contacting the carrier directly; they will notify you via email once the shipment has been dispatched. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "shipping-delivery-times",
            "question": "Where can I track the status of my order?",
            "answer": "<p>Once your order has been processed, you will receive a confirmation email that includes a link to track your shipment. You can also check the status of your order at any time directly in your customer account. </p>"
          }
        },
        "faq-5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "category": "shipping-delivery-times",
            "question": "Where can I find pickup locations?",
            "answer": "<p>Customers select pickup locations or parcel boxes directly when completing their order in the shopping cart. Available locations are displayed based on the selected carrier and delivery address. </p>"
          }
        },
